; LisaPaint phrase file: alerts and menus (lisa-c tools/phrasec.py).
;
; Alerts are full sentences, two spaces after a period, addressing the user
; as "you"; irreversible actions end with the "even with Undo" formula.
; Menus follow the Office System: File/Print first, no Quit, no Close.
