1 note alert
LisaPaint could not find the message that should appear here.  If you are
unable to proceed, mention the number ^N to the person who gave you LisaPaint.

2 stop alert
LisaPaint is having technical difficulties and must stop.  Your other
documents are not affected.

1001 caution alert
Do you really want the picture to revert to the version you last saved?
^L^L
If you want to leave the picture as it is now, click Cancel.  Once you click
OK, you will not be able to change your mind, even with Undo.

1002 stop alert
LisaPaint cannot save the picture, probably because there is not enough room
on the disk.
^L^L
Make room by discarding documents you no longer need or by moving some to
another disk, then try again.

1003 stop alert
LisaPaint cannot read the picture from the disk, so it has started a new,
blank picture instead.

